            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kwape kedumunia ŋinituŋanan ainakinet, kijaanakis lucekus kaŋin, kwape ikeŋadak luejok luka asianut naka Edeke naka iponesio luipu; ",
